OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThrough this
OL,6,Fevening and overnight further cloud
OL,7,Fand rain will spill down from the
OL,8,Fnorth, with some heavy bursts in the
OL,9,Fnorthwest. Feeling cooler in the north
OL,10,Fbut staying fairly mild in the south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FRain clearing through
OL,13,FWednesday morning to bring sunny
OL,14,Fspells and scattered showers. It will
OL,15,Ffeel markedly cooler with winds
OL,16,Fincreasing, and especially cool around
OL,17,Fcoasts where winds will become strong.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
