OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FOn
OL,6,FThursday, sunny spells with showers
OL,7,Feasing, feeling cool in a
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly breeze. Cloud
OL,9,Fthickening, bringing rain and strong
OL,10,Fwinds into Friday. Becoming more
OL,11,Fsettled later on Friday and Saturday.
